WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.140
From the Host List, tap the three-dot menu in the top corner.

2
00:00:04.767 --> 00:00:12.287
Choose Settings. This changes ConnectBot&#x27;s app-wide settings, rather than the settings for an individual host.

3
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:17.940
Scroll down to the Keyboard section. Look for Special keys always visible.

4
00:00:18.567 --> 00:00:24.967
Turn on Special keys always visible. This keeps the terminal&#x27;s special-key toolbar on screen

5
00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:29.567
Go back to the Host List. Your setting is saved automatically.

6
00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:36.087
Open a terminal session. The special keys now stay visible and doesn&#x27;t overlap the terminal.
